== the servers ==
the MQTT stand-in listens on the loopback
the NATS stand-in listens on the loopback
the chat server listens, #iot mirrored to MQTT chat/rooms/iot, #ops to NATS chat.rooms.ops

== accounts ==
alice registers: a new account
bob registers: a new account
alice registers again: the name is taken
alice signs in with a wrong password: refused, "the name or the password is wrong"
alice and bob sign in and get their tokens

