== alice types, sends, then edits across a grapheme cluster ==
alice typed 12 graphemes from 18 keys: "team 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 ready|" byte 36, grapheme 12, column 13
bob's status line: alice sta scrivendo…
bob's status line once it is sent: ""
Up calls her message back to edit: "team 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 ready|" byte 36, grapheme 12, column 13
six times Left: "team 👨‍👩‍👧‍👦| ready" byte 30, grapheme 6, column 7
once more Left steps over the family: "team |👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 ready" byte 5, grapheme 5, column 5
Right, then Backspace takes the family whole: "team | ready" byte 5, grapheme 5, column 5
a technologist pasted: "team 👩‍💻| ready" byte 16, grapheme 6, column 7
[bob's screen]
   bob · #general · 2 persone in linea
  ┌ general ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
  │── sabato 21 novembre 2026 ──                                 │
  │15:00 alice: good morning ☀️                                  │
  │15:01 alice: standup in ten minutes                           │
  │15:02 alice: the build is green ✅                            │
  │15:03 alice: coffee first ☕                                  │
  │15:04 alice: team 👩‍💻 ready (modificato)                       │
  │                                                              │
  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
  
  >

== a direct message ==
alice's status line: 1 unread in @bob
bob writes to nobody, his status line: rifiutato: no one is named "nobody"

== #iot, mirrored to MQTT ==
the sensor published; alice's client got from sensor-7 by MQTT: temperature 21.5 C 🌡️
alice answered; the sensor heard on chat/rooms/iot: alice: fan on 🌀

== #ops, mirrored to NATS ==
the bot published; alice's client got from deploy-bot by NATS: release 1.4 is out 🚀
alice answered; the bot heard on chat.rooms.ops: alice: thanks 🎉
[alice's screen]
