== the HTTP API ==
GET /rooms/general/messages?limit=2 with a token: 200, coffee first ☕ | team 👩‍💻 ready, more true
the same with no token: 401, the request carries no token
GET /health: 200, 2 online

== bob leaves ==
bob pressed Ctrl-C: done true
