== the stop ==
chat server: 11 requests, 45 commands; 2 users, 3 rooms, 9 messages, 1 direct; bridge 2 out, 2 in
nats stand-in: 2 connections, 2 published, 2 delivered
mqtt stand-in: 2 connections, 2 published, 2 delivered
the demo's database folder removed: true
